{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22410","headline":"再到襄阳访问旧居 · 白居易","name":"再到襄阳访问旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔到襄阳日，髯髯初有髭。\n今过襄阳日，髭鬓半成丝。\n旧游都是梦，乍到忽如归。\n东郭蓬蒿宅，荒凉今属谁。\n故知多零落，闾井亦迁移。\n独有秋江水，烟波似旧时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}